{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l001", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 1, "raw": "Колу тийбес жок карашып,", "text": "Колу тийбес жок карашып,", "en": "They faced one another, with no hand left idle,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Opening words are pale; this reading is provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l002", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 2, "raw": "Калың элдин жыйлашып,", "text": "Калың элдин жыйлашып,", "en": "The teeming people gathered together,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final verb is pale and may be a nearby form.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l003", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 3, "raw": "Ак башына орнолор,", "text": "Ак башына орнолор,", "en": "The white-headed elders took their places,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The subject and verb are uncertain in the pale hand.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l004", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 4, "raw": "Миң башчылар башындап,", "text": "Миң башчылар башындап,", "en": "The commanders of thousands took the lead,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final verb is a contextual reading.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l005", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 5, "raw": "Жүзгө башчы шакданып,", "text": "Жүзгө башчы шакданып,", "en": "The commanders of hundreds made ready,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The last word is difficult and the translation is contextual.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l006", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 6, "raw": "Эл чуркурап дүң келди,", "text": "Эл чуркурап дүң келди,", "en": "The people clamored and surged in tumult,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l007", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 7, "raw": "Эки канзаада бу болуп,", "text": "Эки канзаада бу болуп,", "en": "The two khan-princes stood thus,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The middle word is read as канзаада but is faint.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l008", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 8, "raw": "Калк калкылдап турду эми.", "text": "Калк калкылдап турду эми.", "en": "Now the multitude stood swaying like a flood.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l009", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 9, "raw": "Каарданып камынып,", "text": "Каарданып камынып,", "en": "He grew wrathful and made ready,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l010", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 10, "raw": "Улук экен Чыңтеңир,", "text": "Улук экен Чыңтеңир,", "en": "Great indeed was Chyngteñir,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l011", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 11, "raw": "Чын каары күч жан экен,", "text": "Чын каары күч жан экен,", "en": "He was a man of truly mighty wrath,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The opening phrase is somewhat faint.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l012", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 12, "raw": "Сөөлөтү мынча бар экен.", "text": "Сөөлөтү мынча бар экен.", "en": "Such majesty was his.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first word is pale but context supports сөөлөтү.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l013", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 13, "raw": "Көк арстан түрдөнүп,", "text": "Көк арстан түрдөнүп,", "en": "Taking on the aspect of a blue lion,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l014", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 14, "raw": "Күн күркүрөп үндөнүп,", "text": "Күн күркүрөп үндөнүп,", "en": "His voice thundered like the heavens,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l015", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 15, "raw": "Боз аскардай көрүнүп,", "text": "Боз аскардай көрүнүп,", "en": "He appeared like a gray mountain peak,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l016", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 16, "raw": "Болжоп турган адамдын,", "text": "Болжоп турган адамдын,", "en": "Of the man who stood and beheld him,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first word may be a different participle.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l017", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 17, "raw": "Акылы айран бөлүнүп,", "text": "Акылы айран бөлүнүп,", "en": "The wits were confounded and scattered,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l018", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 18, "raw": "Эки көздө чок күйүп,", "text": "Эки көздө чок күйүп,", "en": "Embers burned in his two eyes,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The postposition/case ending is difficult; sense is clear.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l019", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 19, "raw": "Муруту бузук көрүнүп,", "text": "Муруту бузук көрүнүп,", "en": "His mustache looked fierce and wild,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l020", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 20, "raw": "Бу Кап-Тоонун шагындай,", "text": "Бу Кап-Тоонун шагындай,", "en": "Like the crag of this Mount Kap,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l021", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 21, "raw": "Көзү күйгөн жалындай,", "text": "Көзү күйгөн жалындай,", "en": "His eyes were like burning flame,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l022", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 22, "raw": "Көхардан топчу муштумдай,", "text": "Көхардан топчу муштумдай,", "en": "His jeweled buttons were as large as fists,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Көхардан is read with help from the printed counterpart; manuscript spelling is pale.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l023", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 23, "raw": "Көркөмүн көрсөң ушундай.", "text": "Көркөмүн көрсөң ушундай.", "en": "Such was his splendor, if you saw him.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l024", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 24, "raw": "Бет алып бенде көп кытай", "text": "Бет алып бенде көп кытай", "en": "The many Chinese who faced him", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l025", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 25, "raw": "Беттеп карап тура албай,", "text": "Беттеп карап тура албай,", "en": "Could not stand looking him in the face,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l026", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 26, "raw": "Төрөгө карап сөз айта албай,", "text": "Төрөгө карап сөз айта албай,", "en": "Could not look at the lord and utter a word,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "A manuscript variant absent from the nearby printed counterpart; reading is clear enough but lightly written.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l027", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 27, "raw": "Көргөн жандан түңүлүп,", "text": "Көргөн жандан түңүлүп,", "en": "Every soul who saw him lost heart,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l028", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 28, "raw": "Көк жалдыгы билинип.", "text": "Көк жалдыгы билинип.", "en": "His blue-maned valor was plain to see.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l029", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 29, "raw": "Айкырып салып кеп баштап,", "text": "Айкырып салып кеп баштап,", "en": "With a shout, he began to speak,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l030", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 30, "raw": "Айгайлабай бек туруп,", "text": "Айгайлабай бек туруп,", "en": "Standing firm without raising a clamor,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first word may be Айгайлабай; the handwriting is pale.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l031", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 31, "raw": "Ачууланып акырды,", "text": "Ачууланып акырды,", "en": "He roared out in anger,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l032", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 32, "raw": "Айкырыгын укканда,", "text": "Айкырыгын укканда,", "en": "When they heard his shout,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf046:l033", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 46, "folio": 429, "line_in_page": 33, "raw": "Эрендин баары жалтактап.", "text": "Эрендин баары жалтактап.", "en": "All the warriors flinched and glanced about.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "visually_transcribed", "uncertainty_note": "", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf047:l001", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 47, "folio": 430, "line_in_page": 1, "raw": "Эсилерге кайраттан,", "text": "Эсилерге кайраттан,", "en": "Take courage before the elders,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Opening words are pale; Эсилерге is provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf047:l002", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 47, "folio": 430, "line_in_page": 2, "raw": "Шабдандын тукумун,", "text": "Шабдандын тукумун,", "en": "You descendant of Shabdan,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The proper name is read provisionally as Шабдан.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf047:l003", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 47, "folio": 430, "line_in_page": 3, "raw": "Бейпилдей сап болуп,", "text": "Бейпилдей сап болуп,", "en": "Standing in a peaceful rank,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The first word is difficult; translation follows the apparent sense.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf047:l004", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 47, "folio": 430, "line_in_page": 4, "raw": "Жиндилигин барда соо болду,", "text": "Жиндилигин барда соо болду,", "en": "While his madness lasted, he became sound,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "Several medial letters are faint; syntax and translation are provisional.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf047:l005", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 47, "folio": 430, "line_in_page": 5, "raw": "Хан экени билинет.", "text": "Хан экени билинет.", "en": "It is known that he is a khan.", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The line is visually clear, though punctuation is editorial.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf047:l006", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 47, "folio": 430, "line_in_page": 6, "raw": "Акылы бар билген жан,", "text": "Акылы бар билген жан,", "en": "A knowing soul possessed of wisdom,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The final word is pale but contextually likely.", "bbox": null}
{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf047:l007", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 47, "folio": 430, "line_in_page": 7, "raw": "Кайран жандан түңүлүп,", "text": "Кайран жандан түңүлүп,", "en": "Despairing of that noble soul,", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The middle noun may have a different case ending.", "bbox": null}
