{"id": "sayakbay-ms-current146:pdf047:l022", "source_id": "sayakbay-ms-current146", "pdf_sha256": "f13de4f4bc48f2da4eb502e29e9b2b340648255ef7769b069e86d24c617319a4", "page": 47, "folio": 430, "line_in_page": 22, "raw": "Кайран бекен ал Кенен?", "text": "Кайран бекен ал Кенен?", "en": "Was that Kenen truly such a noble man?", "classification": "narrative", "transcription_status": "uncertain", "uncertainty_note": "The second word may be бекен; the rhetorical sense is clear.", "bbox": null}
